      "conversion": "MixinExtras @WrapOperation on the file writes inside SavedData.save(File), PlayerDataStorage.save, PlayerAdvancements.save and ServerStatsCounter.save (the content is still built on the server thread: NBT serialized to its uncompressed bytes, the advancements and stats text); one daemon writer thread (bons.furious.patch.save_writer.SaveWriter) gzips and writes them in submission order with the same stream stack and the same temporary-file replace; waits (@WrapOperation before File.exists/isFile/Files.isRegularFile in the loaders, @Inject HEAD of NbtIo's file readers, DimensionDataStorage.readTagFromDisk and LevelStorageAccess close/deleteLevel/makeWorldBackup/renameLevel, after level.dat in saveAllChunks with flush, RETURN of ServerLevel.save with flush); synchronous (after a wait) off the thread of a running server, for SavedData classes declaring their own save(File), and for player .dat files while PlayerEvent.SaveToFile has a listener",
      "license": "Minecraft (Mojang): no-copy; the mixins and helpers carry only our own logic (helpers in bons.furious.patch.save_writer)"
