      "conversion": "MixinExtras @WrapOperation on File.createTempFile, NbtIo.writeCompressed and Util.safeReplaceFile inside LevelStorageAccess.saveDataTag (level.dat's tag is still built on the server thread and serialized there; the shared background writer of vanilla_background_saves creates the temporary file, gzips the recorded bytes into it and replaces level.dat, keeping level.dat_old); waits at HEAD of the level.dat readers and close/deleteLevel/makeWorldBackup/renameLevel, and after level.dat in saveAllChunks with flush; synchronous (after a wait) off the thread of a running server",
